        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, production mix CH, Bereich 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, production mix CH, Bereich 4
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for the year 2018.;
UUID: 5f6b057b-7759-319d-bc12-b757bd795c59
Included are the shares of domestic electricity production by technology at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Switzerland.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistical data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5f6b057b-7759-319d-bc12-b757bd795c59.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
